    /// The room's record retention states no rule for any of the kinds asked — no `tombstoneDays` for `retracted`, no `recordDays` for `aged`, or no retention at all — so no record is eligible, and none ever was. Set one first with `rooms/records/retention/set`. `details.recordRetention` carries the retention in force, absent when there is none.
    ///
